  ✓ not sandboxed
gui
  ✓ devlanes-gui 0.3.0 at /opt/devlanes/devlanes-gui
  ✓ GUI backend test-pattern
  ! no H.264: OpenH264 is not installed, so GUI windows stream as whole pictures, which is slow over a network
    OpenH264 is not installed: none of libopenh264.so.8, libopenh264.so.7, libopenh264.so.6, libopenh264.so loads
    fix: install it with the package manager: apt install libopenh264-8 (libopenh264-7 on Debian 12 and Ubuntu 24.04, libopenh264-6 on Ubuntu 22.04), dnf install openh264 (from Fedora's fedora-cisco-openh264 repository), pacman -S openh264 or apk add openh264; then restart the GUI services
